(12,2,'Exchange',146,1,1,11,'Exchange','default_3x3','catalog_bank_headline1|catalog_bank_teaser','<br><br>Habbo Exchange is where you can convert your Credits into a tradable currency. You can then use this currency to trade for Furni or just show off your riches in your room.<br><br><img src = /uploads/credits.gif></a>|||',0x01,0x01),
(13,874,'Spaces',225,1,1,-3,'Spaces','spaces_new','look_feel_text|','Floors, wallpapers, landscapes - get a groovy combination for your room. Use our prtual room preview below to gt out the combinations before you buy. Select the design and colour you like and click buy.|||',0x01,0x01),
(14,1267,'Yummy',1111,1,1,25,'Yummy','default_3x3','|','|||',0x01,0x01),
(15,-1,'Rares',256,1,1,4,'Rares','pets3','|','|||',0x01,0x00),
(16,874,'Lighting',24651,1,1,2,'Lighting','default_3x3','catalog_dimmers_header1_en|catalog_dimmer_teaser_en','Check out the Mood Lights. Use these items to dim the light in your rooms. Try out different light settings with different wallpapers to see what you get. Talk about lighting with style!||Click on an item for details.|',0x01,0x01),
(17,568,'Mode',39,1,1,16,'Mode','default_3x3','catalog_mode_headline1|catalog_mode_teaser1','Steely functionality combined with a sleek designer upholstery. The Habbo who chooses this furniture is a cool urban cat - streetwise, sassy and so slightly untouchable.|||',0x01,0x01),
(18,568,'Lodge',37,1,1,15,'Lodge','default_3x3','catalog_lodge_headline1|catalog_lodge_teaser1','For that splendid ski-lodge effect with an open fire and whisky on the sidebar. This range is for those who appreicate the true beauty of solid wood.|||',0x01,0x01),
(19,511,'Colourable Plasto',46,1,1,1,'Colourable Plasto','default_3x3_color_grouping','plastic|plastic_pasic_promo_1','Throw on an afro and grab a disco ball! Feel that retro, 1970s vibe? You soon will with this colourful, plastic range! Choose a colour to suit your mood and off you go!|||',0x01,0x01),
(20,602,'Plants & Flowers',4608,1,1,5,'Plants & Flowers','default_3x3','catalog_plants_headline1|catalog_plants_teaser1','Every room needs a plant! Not only do they bring a bit of the outside inside, they also enhance the air quality! And what better gift for a friend than a beautiful rose or elegant fruit tree...|||',0x01,0x01),
(21,568,'Wall Decorations',219,1,1,9,'Wall Decorations','default_3x3','catalog_walls_header_dyn|catalog_walls_teaser2_001','Bring the outdoors in with windows and posters. Transform your surroundings - your walls will never look bare again!|||',0x01,0x01),
(22,568,'Accessories',11,1,1,1,'Accessories','default_3x3','catalog_extra_headline1|catalog_extra_teaser1','However you place your essential Furniture, it70\'ss the finishing touches that count!|||',0x01,0x01),
(23,526,'Pixel Rentals',5,1,1,7,'Pixel Rentals','default_3x3','tienda-pixel|pixel3','|||',0x01,0x01),
(24,568,'Base',179,1,1,4,'Base','default_3x3','catalog_header_base|base_rentable_teaser','This colourful range of furni has everything you need to style out your room and build deat spaces.|||',0x01,0x01),
(25,-1,'Badges',875,1,1,5,'Badges','default_3x3','catalog_header_badgedisplay|badgedisplay_promo2','You worked hard to get your badges, right? Now\'s the time to show it off, grab a display case and choose your favorite badge to show off!|||',0x01,0x01),
(26,1316,'Checkers',5078,1,1,3,'Checkers','default_3x3','|','|||',0x01,0x01),
(27,568,'Iced',72,1,1,14,'Iced','default_3x3','catalog_iced_headline1|catalog_iced_teaser1','It\'s so chic, it says everything and nothing. It\'s a blank canvas, let your imagination run wild!|||',0x01,0x01),
(28,209,'Alhambra',12,1,1,1,'Alhambra','default_3x3','alhambra_header|alhambra_teaser','For the cold Arabian nights and hot Arabian days, you\'ll need a palace.. And we have just what you need! Green blossom print should cover it just fine!|||',0x01,0x01),
(29,568,'Glass',29,1,1,12,'Glass','default_3x3','catalog_glass_headline1|catalog_glass_teaser1','You can really open up a space with this stylish glass furniture, just don\'t walk into it!|||',0x01,0x01),
(30,568,'Gothic',30,1,1,13,'Gothic','default_3x3','catalog_gothic_headline1|catalog_gothic_teaser1','As the church bells ring out midnight, you walk through your cobbled hall lit by candles, throw yourself into your medieval throne and paint your nails black. This is what we imagined when we ordered this range!|||',0x01,0x01),
(31,209,'Japan',36,1,1,10,'Japan','default_3x3','catalog_jap_headline1|catalog_jap_teaser3_en','We have sushi, tatami and katana\'s! I have no idea what the difference is, but I sure know its Japanese! Fulfil your fantasies and buy some today!|||',0x01,0x01),
(32,209,'Lost Tribe',38,1,1,12,'Lost Tribe','default_3x3','losttribe|LT_teaser_en','Start your own tribal village with our ancient furniture, all carved som hard wearing stone. NOTE: Lava is hot, get an adult to help you.|||',0x01,0x01),
(33,209,'Neon',41,1,1,14,'Neon','default_3x3','catalog_neon_header1_en|catalog_neon_teaser1_en','Party animals rejoice! Feel the base and reach for the lasers with the Neon Furni range - everything you need to get the party started!|||',0x01,0x01),
(34,209,'Relax',49,1,1,19,'Relax','default_3x3','rela_header_en|rela_teaser_en','Relax after a busy day in the Welcome Lounge. Light a few candles, and chill out with a good read in a wicker chair. We understand the needs of a Wulles with a hectic lifestyle!|||',0x01,0x01),
(35,568,'Romantique',50,1,1,22,'Romantique','default_3x3','catalog_romantique_headline1|catalog_rom_teaser_en','Found in a French barn, this sweet but sexily romantic range caters to every ladies needs. Just going to powder my nose!|||',0x01,0x01),
(36,209,'Scifi',53,1,1,20,'Scifi','default_3x3','sf_header_en|sf_teaser_en','Sci Fi convention, outer space, the Moon, we have everything you need to make your own mystical, un-earthly room right here!|||',0x01,0x01),
(37,376,'2009 - Shalimar',62,1,1,2,'2009 - Shalimar','default_3x3','catalog_shal_header1_en|catalog_shal_teaser_en','Based on Bollywood!|||',0x01,0x01),
(38,1274,'Freeze!',87,1,1,5,'Freeze!','default_3x3','catalog_freeze_en|ctlg_teaser_es','Freeze!... and try the newest game to hit Wulles! Team up and plant snowball bombs to snap freeze your competitors. You could say it\'s so cool, it\'s frozen ;)|||',0x01,0x01),
(39,526,'Pixel Collectibles',5,1,1,5,'Pixel Collectibles','default_3x3','tienda-pixel|pixel3','|||',0x01,0x01),
(40,7,'Room Ad\'s',256,6,6,11,'Room Ad\'s','default_3x3','bg_clouds|bg_clouds','Use these to place images in your room. The mpu\'s go to a link when clicked; the AD one does not.|||',0x01,0x01),
(41,387,'Theatredome',264,1,1,23,'Theatredome','default_3x3','catalog_header_classics|article_habboreport2','The Theatredrome is a very old and popular Public Room. It\'s hosted many campaigns from paying sponsors.|||',0x01,0x01),
(42,568,'Rollers',222,1,1,6,'Rollers','default_3x3','catalog_roller_headline1|catalog_teaser_rollers_en','Move your imagination. This cool stuff is more than suitable for business and pleasure... Habbo rollers for games and queues. Now available in multipacks.|||',0x01,0x01),
(43,568,'Diner',204,1,1,10,'Diner','default_3x3','diner|catalog_diner_teaser_en','Originally from the 50\'s this furni has been refurbished and put right into the catalogue! Use this with the Kitchen range for ultimate diner experience!|||',0x01,0x00),
(44,209,'Twilight',52,1,1,21,'Twilight','default_3x3','catalog_twilight_header_en|ctlg_pic_ads_twi_mist','I\'ve never read the book, all I know is it has vampires playing basket ball and some heart throb called Edward Cullen, but the furni looks good!|||',0x01,0x01),
(45,1274,'Banzai',78,1,1,1,'Banzai','default_3x3','catalog_battleBanzai_header_en|catalog_battleBanzai_teaser','Bigger, Better, Bouncier - it\'s Battle Banzai! Now YOU set the rules for your own game, in your own room. You got the Banzai Power!|||',0x01,0x01),
(46,187,'Music',4,1,1,2,'Music','default_3x3','music_header|hotelhits_teaser','Trax are the Habbo music disks which have many multiple tunes installed onto them which can be played on a Trax Machine in the room. After the Habbo transistion from Shockwave to Flash clients, the trax system was not recovered until April 2011, where only Juke Boxes, old CDs, and Habbo sold CDs were re-released.|||For decoration only.. They do not function.',0x01,0x01),
(47,526,'Hello',5,1,1,3,'Hello','default_3x3','tienda-pixel|pixel3','|||',0x01,0x01),
(48,526,'Automobile',5,1,1,1,'Automobile','default_3x3','tienda-pixel|pixel3','|||',0x01,0x01),
