(240,376,'Functional Love Locks',62,1,1,2,'Functional Love Locks','default_3x3','catalog_header_val12|val14_lovelock3','Friendship Padlocks are Furni that show how special your friends are. You and your friend need to be in your room. Put the Padlock in the Room, click 2x on it, and confirm the action. Once closed, your friendship will be saved forever, even if you trade it!|||',0x01,0x01),
